      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_comparing_to_primates",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "This is a well-documented racist trope that dehumanizes Black individuals by equating them with apes or monkeys. It is used to justify discrimination, reinforce racial hierarchies, and perpetuate harmful stereotypes. The meme uses the green-skinned ape-like figure to visually represent this stereotype, which is not directly visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's hateful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
